   180	
   181	Trusted components are the supplied read-only MPY semantics, K's parser and
   182	LLVM/Haskell backends, the K logical kernel, and the stated interpretation of
   183	MPY constructors as the benchmark's Python subset. `py2mpy.py` is trusted only
